<title>GERMANY: German Jan steel output up 12 pct yr-on-yr.</title>
<headline>German Jan steel output up 12 pct yr-on-yr.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistics Office gave the following data on pan-German steel production in January(in millions of tonnes):</p>
<p>		    Jan	Pct change</p>
<p> Pig iron	 2.41	+11.9</p>
<p> Crude steel    3.38	+12.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Percentage changes are against year-earlier figures.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
